<div class="head"><div><h1 class="h1-obj"><span class="desktop-only">Contract · fixture</span><span class="phone-only">Contract</span></h1>
<p class="lede rules-ctx">Basic (Landlock) · run <a class="mono link" href="/runs/r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx" title="r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx">r-…PATH</a> · running · <span class="detail-value mono" title="…PATH">…PATH</span></p></div>
<details class="head-more"><summary>Actions</summary><div class="head-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg>Edit contract</a></div></details></div>

<p class="page-intro phone-only">Rules for <strong class="detail-value">fixture</strong>.</p><details class="detail-disclosure contract-details"><summary>Contract details and other runs</summary><div class="panel-body"><form class="frow rules-pick" action="/rules" method="get" aria-label="Choose the rules to show">
  <label class="field rp-file">Contract file<select class="select" name="c"><option value="…PATH" selected>fixture · …PATH</option></select></label>
  <label class="field rp-run">Run<select class="select" name="run"><option value="r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx" selected>r-…PATH</option></select></label>
  <button class="btn" type="submit">Show</button>
</form><p class="note"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg><span>Line numbers are the run&#39;s own copy of its rules: the rules file no longer loads to the rules this run ran.</span></p><p class="note"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-shield"/></svg><span>The run left no copy of its rules.</span></p><p>Basic (Landlock)</p><p>Agent recorded by this run: <strong class="detail-value">fixture</strong>.</p><p>Run <a class="text-link" href="/runs/r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx">r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx</a>, started <time datetime="2026-10-26T12:00:00Z">2026-10-26 12:00:00.000 UTC</time>.</p><p class="detail-value mono">…PATH</p><a class="text-link" href="/rules">All contracts</a></div></details>


<section class="panel rules-pending rp-live" aria-labelledby="h-pending"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-pending"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg>Rules file differs from this run</h2></div><div class="panel-body stack-sm">
  <details class="row-details pending-details"><summary>Contract file</summary><p class="soft">The next run of <span class="detail-value mono">…PATH</span> gets the file's rules as they are now · this run keeps its own</p></details>
  
  <p>The file's rules differ from what this run ran, and nothing dates the change: a profile it extends changed, or this run started from another version of the file · not live on this run</p>
  <p class="soft">To apply all: stop it (<a class="link" href="/runs/r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx/stop">Stop this run</a>); its next run gets these rules:</p>
  <div class="cli"><code>tego run …PATH</code></div><p class="soft"><span title="Same contract file and command; add options the run was started with, such as --tier or --record">Restart with</span></p>
</div></section>






<section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-read"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-read"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-eye"/></svg>Can read <span class="soft">Files the agent can open and read.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default"><span>Can read any other file on this computer, except the ones under Never reads and Always on.</span></div></section><section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-change"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-change"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg>Can change <span class="soft">Files and folders the agent can create, edit or delete.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default"><span>Cannot change any file.</span></div></section><section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-programs"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-programs"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-terminal"/></svg>Programs <span class="soft">The programs the agent can start.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default is-open"><span class="b b-neutral" title="Wide open: a contract usually narrows this"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-triangle-alert"/></svg>Open</span><span>Can run any program.</span><a class="link r-narrow" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH">Narrow this</a></div></section><section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-network"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-network"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-activity"/></svg>Network <span class="soft">Where the agent can connect.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default is-open"><span class="b b-neutral" title="Wide open: a contract usually narrows this"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-triangle-alert"/></svg>Open</span><span>Can connect to any address. Other programs&#39; local sockets stay closed (see Always on).</span><a class="link r-narrow" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH">Narrow this</a></div></section><section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-env"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-env"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-key-round"/></svg>Settings it gets <span class="soft">Environment variables the agent starts with, by name. Values are never shown here.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default is-open"><span class="b b-neutral" title="Wide open: a contract usually narrows this"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-triangle-alert"/></svg>Open</span><span>Gets every variable in your shell, secrets included.</span><a class="link r-narrow" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH">Narrow this</a></div></section><section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-limits"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-limits"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-square"/></svg>Limits <span class="soft">When the run is stopped or slowed down.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default"><span>No limits of its own: this computer&#39;s defaults apply.</span></div></section><section class="panel rules-g phone-table" aria-labelledby="g-always-on"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-always-on"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-shield"/></svg>Always on <span class="soft">Protections every run gets, written in no rules file.</span></h2></div>
